        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Reekusiinda aba sanaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga eaduupcheewi, geagasayi anala gideaba, gheambaghweanigaasa ghayi gookwa shamooghooda sean, ak ghoaghaawa sean basooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amang'ata geepaatiisan sean ghoah fuga Musa aba jeeda shamooghooda ea jeeda basooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ama ng'ata ghwaak sean hamitida bea gurooroodean ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghwali sean beegiga bea gurooroodean. Aba gideaba ghwaleaydaawa badayda lagheaneeda was guroorooda ghayi aat geeshta, nea lagheaneedida ea Gristohi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gwanda fuga saang'a aba jeenyaawa magassa ASEETA; ama muchu gealas uhuuda aba dareapcheeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa ng'asheesu niiw reekusiinda aba heedeanya, ak abeeda ea meegasi ng'asheega munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea adoowooschi fuga bada sanaamu, ak goowuurjeewi giduurji fuga mwaatkwa; gawuurji gidaghayi sing'waar bea gideaba, “Buuneeda ghayi goobiitpiit gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi, ama ng'ata ghang'eatng'eat ghwadaanghan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea adeemealuuli ak geewuurjeewi gidasiinda fuga mwaatkwa aba jeenyaawa, ak ghoabeada fih sagalamnyooji diktam ea samwagu eaweecheanjagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea adaghanyi eesina Ng'utamiida, ak geewuurjeewi gidaghayi simda fuga mwaatkwa aba jeenyaawa, ak ghwaak ichipkeega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea adoanikghti gidaghayi aniikghta fuga mwaatkwa aba jeenyaawa, ak ghwalas uhuuda habitkwajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa, ng'asheesu ghwanyas nea gawuurji reekusiinda, ak geang'waar ghoahiimu gichea eabeada, aba heeda fuga jea gweadu muudeanooda gweanyeeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi siida eesha geaw gimiinaadi dang'ula geaw adiidu ghoabeada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda simsimda ninyaseagwa agooga mawoosa dea gealaan aba heeda siida. ASEETA doabiiwaat, nea niny ea mayghwanung'waada eesimeegwa ea ghwanaawa uurjeengeagwa, earapeadi jea eesimeegwean gaygwasin naweeda jea ariteawana ak abeeda ghoamuuschi arjeang'da.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi fugeasu aabwariinyi, aba sareani anung'waada badita sanaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geabalooldaneegwa fuga mideawa fughareenga; asi ooteemsheesiina agooga ng'asheesu earguun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayooktida bea ghawooda siipareanyi aba ghawoodean, heapi mii giibareanyeeda foojeanda Gristohi? Ama mukaateeyda sibwanajaadi mii giibareanyeeda saseeda Gristohi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwanda mukaateeheanagi, nea aseasa geewooschi saang'a ak geewooschi saseanagi, aba gideaba aseasa eesa sean geanyaschi banajaneedeaba mukaateeydida asagiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'ula fuga Israeli; neada ea mii fugiga ghayi ak haleanjeeda ghasmeahooda abiita heeda wagiida? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gaydayiin? Gaydayi hamita sighadoawana sanaamu gili, ghana maloonghajeanda gili? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda, gearugu gideaba haleanjeedida sisapa geadi adayda fuga mandeawana masaweega ghoadaw meangeenda nea moadawa ASEETA. Ak ea meagassi aniini gideaba gajabareanyeewana meangeenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Majoammuusa aleayda gikoombeeyda Ng'utamiida ea gikoombeeyda meangeenda. Ak ea majoamuusa oopareanyeena measeeda Ng'utamiida ea measeeda meangeenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghana sigasayi eang'udana Ng'utamiida lachng'eanyiida? Neada geandeawi uurda ea eeburdeawana niny?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Haleanjeeda sean ghwahit,” ak ea mii haleanjeeda sean gil gea jea ghaweat fih. “Haleanjeeda sean ghwahit,” ak ea mii sean gil gea jea gwadeegu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida adagagakiisa geaw haleanjeeda miyaas, ghang'wana gagasa ghwanyas giischeewoocheandaanyi gidamiy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayaaga haleanjeeda sean siikghaas aba heeda sisheahiideawa banyeega was jeeda naada nea adoonyeariidi aba gidamwachmwach fughareedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba, “Ng'eanyiida gaba Ng'utamiida, sea haleanjeeda sean mida jeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi iiguurneey siida mandeawana masaweega hamiteaba shing'ada ak gigasayi beata, aga gida wassean sigoonyi nea adinyaashti ng'asheanda wassean aba gidamwachmwach fughareeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ama deepa gwayeeshiineey sih, “Gili geataydaawa lukghumajeega,” iidu nea mang'uleey siida ghwanyawa rukuneey, ea aba gidamwachmwach fughareeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gearugu gidida mwachmwach fughareadaanyiin, mii geagwa gil, adiidu giyaagi.) Ghwasaan abeeda inyas giibaldeanyu bea geaw jea goorgweaksa fughareemba siinuut? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda iyaagi nea geabadiischeesi ASEETA, abeeda ghwasaan inyas geeng'eawean aba gili naabwachi ASEETEAN?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
